    "body": "Thank you for this report and for the screenshot.\n\nTriage: **P7** (layout polish), **effort:low**, **area:ui**. The label column of the property grid is too narrow, so some names are cut off with \"...\" when the panel has free space. The fix: let the label column use the free width, and show the full name in a tooltip when it must be cut.\n\nIf you see this in other panels or dialogs too, please add a screenshot here. Your screen scale (for example 100 % or 150 %) also helps.\n",
